    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vision:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, there are no vicious enemies, complex puzzles, swords, or sorcery. Your superhuman leg strength is your only tool\u2014forge your path upward, one leap at a time, to scale heights no one has ever conquered!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charge to Jump:</strong> Hold the jump button to build power\u2014the longer the press, the mightier the leap!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aim &amp; Launch:</strong> Push the left stick to align your direction, then release the button to launch toward the camera\u2019s viewpoint.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Mid-Air Tricks:</strong> Once airborne, movement control locks\u2014commit fully to every jump!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Rules:</strong> Master timing and camera angles. A single miscalculation in pressure or aim could undo all progress! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588820/extras/cb6b0d9bb40f646fd134fe646c008606.poster.avif?t=1744880266\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588820/extras/cb6b0d9bb40f646fd134fe646c008606.webm?t=1744880266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
